      "consequence": "Uncontrollable pitch-roll torque divergence and instant ground rollover.",
      "explanation": "Quadcopter flight requires balanced thrust vectors across all four corners. Loss of one rotor removes 25% lift and breaks pitch/roll equilibrium, causing the PID loop to saturate and the craft to tumble within 80ms."
