      ],
      "consequence": "MOSFET junction temperature exceeds 125°C, causing commutation timing desync and motor stall.",
      "explanation": "Continuous full-throttle flight without adequate airflow overheats the low-side N-channel MOSFETs. The gate driver loses back-EMF zero-crossing detection, triggering hardware thermal shutdown."
    },
